            <title><![CDATA[The potential economic fallout of Trump's trade war with Canada]]></title>
            <link>https://www.pbs.org/newshour/show/the-potential-economic-fallout-of-trumps-trade-war-with-canada</link>
            <description><![CDATA[The trade war between the U.S. and Canada is intensifying after negotiations broke down over the weekend. Canadian Prime Minister Mark Carney said his country had been preparing for a fundamental shift in its relationship with the U.S., which it no longer views as a reliable partner. Geoff Bennett discussed the economic fallout on both sides of the border with Peter Armstrong of the CBC. ]]></description>
